Both patches are applied by build/mdtools.mk (TOOLCHAIN=gnu only) to a
throwaway copy of src/hypervisor/src/support. The Sun toolchain builds
mdgen/mdlint unmodified and uses neither.

gnu/mdgen-mdlint-host-endian.patch
    Gives the network-byte-order macros a little-endian arm and adds one
    hton64() Sun forgot.

gnu/mdgen-mdlint-printf-int64.patch
    PRIx64/PRId64 for uint64_t in the --text/--dot writers. No output
    change.
